# Never baked into any image, even for a stray local `docker build` --
# Render's own git-based build wouldn't pick these up either, but this is
# a second line of defense since Docker only respects .dockerignore, not
# .gitignore.
.git
.gitignore
server/.env
server/.env.example
.idea
.vscode

# Python/Node build + cache artifacts -- reinstalled fresh in the image
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
node_modules
server/node_modules

# Project-local scratch data not needed to run the deployed app
CoordinateData
Operations Research part
README.md
LICENSE
*.log
